  body: |
    # Continental shelf area distinctions in the source

    ## Authored interpretation

    The source distinguishes a UK designated area from a prescribed area involving Norway or other EC countries outside their territorial waters, and warns that accidents and diseases use different definitions.

    ## Scope and boundaries

    DMG 078082–078084 require the relevant statutory definition and purpose. These historical territorial descriptions do not identify a present boundary or establish benefit jurisdiction for a location.

    ## Inspected source passages

    - [DMG 078082, PDF page 7](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a7f779940f0b6230268fabd/dmgch0707.pdf#page=7)
    - [DMG 078083, PDF page 7](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a7f779940f0b6230268fabd/dmgch0707.pdf#page=7)
    - [DMG 078084, PDF page 7](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a7f779940f0b6230268fabd/dmgch0707.pdf#page=7)

